<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1a1a2e">
  <title>မြန်မာ့ရိုးရာပြက္ခဒိန် နက္ခတ်ဗေဒင် V3.5 (Premium)</title>
  <style>
    /* Premium Astrology Theme */
    :root {
      --bg: #1a1a2e; /* Deep night sky */
      --surface: #16213e; /* Slightly lighter surface */
      --surface2: #0f3460;
      --line: #e94560; /* Highlight/Line color */
      
      --gold: #f9a826; /* Premium Gold */
      --gold2: #e0901e;
      --gold3: #c27d1a;
      
      --text: #e6e6e6; /* Off-white for readability */
      --muted: #a0a0a0;
      
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      --shadow-glow: 0 0 15px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2);
      --radius: 16px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    html {
      background: var(--bg);
      color-scheme: dark;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding-bottom: 94px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Noto Sans Myanmar", "Myanmar Text", system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      /* Starry background effect */
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 50%, rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.05), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 30%, rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.05), transparent 25%);
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
    }
    
    body:before {
      content: "✦  ✧  ⋆  ✦  ✧  ✦  ⋆  ✧  ✦  ✧  ⋆  ✦  ✧  ✦  ⋆  ✧  ✦  ✧";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      pointer-events: none;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 4;
      letter-spacing: 3rem;
      word-spacing: 4rem;
    }

    button, input { font: inherit; } 
    button { cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
    a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    
    .app { max-width: 1020px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
    
    .tab-page { animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out forwards; }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface) 0%, var(--surface2) 100%);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow), var(--shadow-glow);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    
    .hero:after {
      content: "✨";
      position: absolute;
      right: 20px;
      top: -20px;
      font-size: 120px;
      color: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.05);
    }
    
    .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px); line-height: 1.3; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    .subtitle { margin: 0 auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; max-width: 800px; }
    
    .teacher-box {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.4);
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.6);
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
    }
    .teacher-box span { color: var(--text); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; }

    /* Page Header */
    .page-head {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      padding: 20px 25px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .page-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; color: #ffffff; }
    .page-head p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

    /* Toolbar Controls */
    .toolbar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;
      gap: 15px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      max-width: 800px;
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    
    .control {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      color: var(--text);
      outline: none;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .control:focus { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2); }
    
    .btn {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold2));
      color: #1a1a2e;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.4); }
    .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
    
    .btn.secondary { background: var(--surface2); color: var(--text); box-shadow: none; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .btn.secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .btn.icon { padding: 10px 15px; min-width: 50px; font-size: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;}

    /* Cards & Sections */
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 25px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    
    .section-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding-bottom: 15px;}
    .section-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: var(--gold); }
    
    .label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;}
    .value { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.4; }
    .sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5px; }

    /* Info Grids */
    .date-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    
    .date-cell {
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.15);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(22, 33, 62, 0.8), rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.9));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .date-cell:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--gold); }
    .date-cell b { display: block; color: var(--gold); font-size: 18px; margin-top: 5px; }

    /* Transit Cards */
    .transit-compare { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    
    .transit-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    
    .transit-card:before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }

    .transit-card.sun:before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #e94560, transparent); }
    
    .transit-card:after { content: "☾"; position: absolute; right: 20px; top: -10px; font-size: 140px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); z-index: 0;}
    .transit-card.sun:after { content: "☀"; top: 0px; font-size: 120px; }
    
    .transit-title { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); display: inline-block; padding: 5px 15px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;}
    .transit-name { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);}
    .transit-card.sun .transit-name { color: #ff6b6b; }
    
    .transit-meta { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); margin-top: 5px; }
    
    .animal-chip {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px; padding: 6px 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 50px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);
    }

    .info-grid {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }
    
    .info-box {
      padding: 12px 15px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .info-box span { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;}
    .info-box b { display: block; margin-top: 5px; font-size: 15px; color: #fff; }
    
    .time-pair {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    
    .time-box {
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2);
      background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.05);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .transit-card.sun .time-box { border-color: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.2); background: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.05); }
    
    .time-box span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 5px;}
    .time-box b { display: block; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; }
    
    .remaining {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); text-align: center;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .remaining span { font-weight: bold; color: var(--gold); }
    .transit-card.sun .remaining span { color: #ff6b6b; }

    /* Calendar Section */
    .month-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
    .month-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; min-width: 160px; text-align: center; color: #fff; }
    
    .calendar {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 15px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    
    .weekdays { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding-bottom: 10px;}
    .weekday { text-align: center; color: var(--gold); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
    
    .days { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
    
    .day {
      min-height: 100px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    
    .day:hover { background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.1); border-color: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3); transform: translateY(-2px);}
    .day.empty { visibility: hidden; }
    
    .day.selected {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.15);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2);
    }
    
    .day.today:before {
      content: "ယနေ့";
      position: absolute;
      right: 5px;
      top: 5px;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #1a1a2e;
      background: var(--gold);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    
    .gday { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: auto;}
    .mdate { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5px; }
    .nak { font-size: 11px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .nak.sun-nak { color: #ff6b6b; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* Selected Day Details */
    .selected-overview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    
    .moonbox {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    
    .moon-orb {
      width: 80px; height: 80px; flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-radius: 50%; position: relative;
      background: #f6edd1;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(246, 237, 209, 0.3);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .moon-shadow { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: #162136; transform-origin: center; transition: all 0.5s ease;}

    .cal-detail-compare { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    
    .cal-detail-card {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .cal-detail-card h3 { margin: 0 0 15px; color: var(--gold); font-size: 18px; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-bottom: 10px;}
    
    .kv {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .kv:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .kv span { color: var(--muted); }
    .kv b { color: #fff; text-align: right; font-weight: 600;}

    /* Nakhat List Tab */
    .nak-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; }
    
    .nak-item {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 15px;
      display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .nak-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-color: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);}
    
    .nno {
      width: 45px; height: 45px;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.1);
      color: var(--gold); font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;
      flex: 0 0 auto; border: 1px solid rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);
    }
    
    .nname { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px;}
    .nmeta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    
    .yoni-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px; color: #ddd; font-size: 13px; }
    .gender { display: inline-flex; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-size: 11px; }

    .fullmoon-table { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .fm-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 15px; font-size: 14px; }
    .fm-row b { color: var(--gold); }
    
    .notice { border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.1); padding: 15px; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.6;}

    /* Contact Tab */
    .contact-wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .contact-intro { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .contact-intro h3 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--gold); }
    .contact-intro p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); }
    
    .contact-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
    .contact-link {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .contact-link:hover { transform: translateX(5px); border-color: var(--gold); background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.05); }
    
    .contact-icon {
      width: 50px; height: 50px; flex: 0 0 auto;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
      border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff;
    }
    .contact-icon img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    
    .contact-link b { display: block; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px;}
    .contact-link span span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

    /* Bottom Navigation */
    .bottom-nav {
      position: fixed; z-index: 100; left: 50%; bottom: 20px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: min(95%, 700px); display: flex; justify-content: space-around;
      padding: 8px;
      background: rgba(22, 33, 62, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    
    .navbtn {
      flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--muted);
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 12px 5px;
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    }
    .navbtn:hover { color: #fff; }
    .navbtn.active { background: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.15); color: var(--gold); }
    
    .copyright { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; padding: 30px 0 10px; opacity: 0.7;}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .date-strip, .selected-overview { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .transit-compare, .cal-detail-compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .app { padding: 10px; }
      .hero { padding: 30px 20px; }
      h1 { font-size: 24px; }
      .toolbar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .date-strip, .selected-overview { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px;}
      .date-cell { padding: 15px; }
      
      .info-grid, .time-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      
      .calendar { padding: 10px; }
      .day { min-height: 80px; padding: 6px; }
      .gday { font-size: 16px; }
      .nak { font-size: 9px; }
      
      .moonbox { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; gap: 15px;}
      .kv { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; }
      .kv b { text-align: left; }
      
      .bottom-nav { width: calc(100% - 20px); bottom: 10px; border-radius: 20px;}
      .navbtn { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px 2px;}
    }

    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; color: #000; }
      .bottom-nav, .toolbar, .btn, .hero:after { display: none !important; }
      .app { padding: 0; max-width: 100%; }
      .card, .transit-card, .calendar, .page-head { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-shadow: none; page-break-inside: avoid;}
      .text, h1, h2, h3, .value, .transit-name { color: #000 !important; text-shadow: none;}
      .day { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">

  <!-- Home Tab -->
  <main id="homeTab" class="tab-page">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Astrology & Almanac</div>
      <h1>မြန်မာ့ရိုးရာပြက္ခဒိန်<br>နက္ခတ်ဗေဒင်</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">မြန်မာရက်စွဲနှင့် နေ့စဉ် စန်းတည်နက္ခတ်၊ တနင်္ဂနွေစီးနက္ခတ်တို့၏ တည်နေရာနှင့် ကူးပြောင်းချိန်များကို တိကျစွာ တွက်ချက်ကြည့်ရှုနိုင်သည်။</p>
      <div class="teacher-box">
        ✦ ဆရာမအေးမြတ်မွန် <span>စီစဉ်သည်</span> ✦
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="toolbar">
      <input id="dateInput" class="control" type="date" aria-label="ရက်စွဲရွေးရန်">
      <input id="timeInput" class="control" type="time" value="12:00" aria-label="အချိန်ရွေးရန်">
      <button id="nowBtn" class="btn">ယနေ့အချိန်သို့ ပြန်သွားရန်</button>
    </div>

    <section class="date-strip">
